    applicability: "Use Minato's procedures if Minato is your responsible municipality and your coverage category calls for a municipal National Pension filing.", responsibleBody: "Minato City", receivingOffice: "National Pension Section of Minato City's National Health Insurance and Pension Division; eligible applications can be mailed or filed through My Number Portal",
